            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The module reflects a hybrid solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) micro gas turbine system with 180 kW electrical output. Inventory based on information from literature and one manufacturer. Life time operation of auxiliary systems is 80'000 h. Stack lifetime is 48'000 h. Lifetime of the micro gas turbine is 50'000 h.;
Synonyms: solid oxide fuel cell hybrid cycle power system, SOFC gas turbine hybrid, SOFC Gasturbinen Hybridsystem, Festoxid Brennstoffzellen Gasturbinen Hybridsystem; 
UUID: c2827bba-837f-3ef4-bfc8-04677fe9493b</common:generalComment>
